[{"id":"retrieval:role:llm-app-engineer","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"role:llm-app-engineer","text":"大模型应用工程师\n把业务需求与可用模型转化为可评价、可集成、可运行、可迭代应用系统的企业工程岗位实例。"},{"id":"retrieval:chain:foundation-model","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"chain:foundation-model","text":"基础模型与模型服务层\n提供通用或行业模型能力、接口及模型服务。"},{"id":"retrieval:chain:llm-application-engineering","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"chain:llm-application-engineering","text":"大模型应用工程层\n组合模型、知识、上下文、工具和软件工程能力，形成可运行应用。"},{"id":"retrieval:chain:industry-application","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"chain:industry-application","text":"行业与业务应用层\n在具体业务流程中使用应用系统并评价其结果与风险。"},{"id":"retrieval:family:ai-application-engineering","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"family:ai-application-engineering","text":"人工智能应用工程岗位群\n围绕AI应用开发、系统集成、运行质量与工程交付形成的岗位群。"},{"id":"retrieval:occupation:CN:2-02-38-01","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"occupation:CN:2-02-38-01","text":"人工智能工程技术人员\n目标岗位的工程主锚；正式范围覆盖人工智能系统设计、集成、部署、运维与应用。"},{"id":"retrieval:occupation:CN:4-04-05-13","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"occupation:CN:4-04-05-13","text":"生成式人工智能系统应用员\n目标岗位的专项规范映射；覆盖生成式AI系统设计、调用、训练、优化、部署、更新和支持。"},{"id":"retrieval:related-role:llm-algorithm-engineer","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"related-role:llm-algorithm-engineer","text":"大模型算法工程师\n主要价值在模型或算法创新、后训练与深度模型优化。"},{"id":"retrieval:related-role:agent-engineer","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"related-role:agent-engineer","text":"AI Agent工程师\n业务Agent是本岗位方向；通用Agent平台内核更接近AI Infra。"},{"id":"retrieval:related-role:backend-engineer","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"related-role:backend-engineer","text":"后端工程师\n共享API、数据与服务能力，但不默认承担模型行为、知识链路和AI质量闭环。"},{"id":"retrieval:related-role:llmops-ai-infra","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"related-role:llmops-ai-infra","text":"MLOps/LLMOps与AI Infra工程师\n主要负责组织级模型、算力、部署和通用平台底座。"},{"id":"retrieval:task:llmapp:define-scenario","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"task:llmapp:define-scenario","text":"界定应用场景与验收要求\n访谈、梳理、判断适用性并把模糊诉求转成可验证要求；交付：场景说明、需求与约束清单、验收标准、初始风险清单；完成边界：目标用户、输入输出、数据与权限边界、不可接受结果和验收方法均被记录并由关键协作方确认。"},{"id":"retrieval:task:llmapp:design-solution","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"task:llmapp:design-solution","text":"设计并验证大模型应用方案\n比较直接调用、RAG、工作流、Agent及条件性模型适配，设计架构并用原型验证关键假设；交付：方案比较记录、架构与数据流设计、可回放原型、技术决策记录；完成边界：选定方案满足场景约束，关键不确定性已通过原型验证，未选方案及理由可追溯。"},{"id":"retrieval:task:llmapp:build-rag","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"task:llmapp:build-rag","text":"构建并维护领域知识与RAG链路\n摄取、解析、分块、索引、检索、重排、引用、版本化并评价检索质量；交付：可更新的知识处理管线、RAG服务或组件、检索评价集与报告、知识版本记录；完成边界：目标知识可按权限被稳定检索和引用，检索组件达到约定指标，更新与回退路径可执行。"},{"id":"retrieval:task:llmapp:build-agent-integration","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"task:llmapp:build-agent-integration","text":"构建Agent工作流与工具系统集成\n实现编排、分支、工具调用、权限、重试、停止、确认、幂等与异常处理；交付：可运行的Agent或工作流、工具与接口契约、链路trace、异常与人工介入设计；完成边界：目标流程可端到端运行，高影响动作受控，失败和重试不产生不可接受副作用。"},{"id":"retrieval:task:llmapp:control-model-behavior","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"task:llmapp:control-model-behavior","text":"实现上下文与模型行为控制\n设计、实现、版本化并测试上下文组装、输出约束、模型选择和必要的领域适配；交付：版本化Prompt与上下文配置、输出schema与校验、模型路由配置、目标案例行为结果；完成边界：配置与模型版本可追溯，目标案例行为可复核，失败模式和回退策略已记录。"},{"id":"retrieval:task:llmapp:evaluate-quality-safety","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"task:llmapp:evaluate-quality-safety","text":"设计并执行质量与安全评测\n建设评测集，执行组件、端到端、对抗与回归评价，分析误差并作发布判断；交付：版本化评测集、评价量规与指标、评测报告、发布或退回结论；完成边界：评测数据覆盖目标分布和关键失败模式，结果可复现，结论与发布门槛直接关联。"},{"id":"retrieval:task:llmapp:release-service","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"task:llmapp:release-service","text":"封装、集成并发布应用服务\n封装服务、集成业务系统、测试、部署、验证负载并准备升级和回滚；交付：可部署服务、集成测试结果、性能与容量记录、发布记录与运行手册；完成边界：目标环境验收通过，版本、配置、依赖和发布决策可追溯，回滚路径经过验证。"},{"id":"retrieval:task:llmapp:operate-improve","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"task:llmapp:operate-improve","text":"监测、诊断并迭代生产应用\n监测运行与业务质量，复现和定位问题，修复、回归、发布或回滚并沉淀经验；交付：监测视图、坏例与根因记录、修复与回归结果、迭代或事故记录；完成边界：问题影响受控，根因和修复有证据，回归通过且发布后复发情况被继续观察。"},{"id":"retrieval:cap:llmapp:scenario-solution-judgment","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"cap:llmapp:scenario-solution-judgment","text":"业务场景分析与AI方案判断\n在业务、数据、风险和成本约束下判断问题是否适合使用大模型，并选择足够且不过度复杂的方案。 表现：能给出可验证场景模型、方案比较与取舍依据，而非只复述需求或追随工具。 价值：降低错误立项、过度设计和无法验收的风险。"},{"id":"retrieval:cap:llmapp:architecture-integration","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"cap:llmapp:architecture-integration","text":"大模型应用架构与集成工程\n把模型、知识、上下文、工作流、工具和业务服务组合为边界清晰、可运行的应用系统。 表现：能定义组件契约、实现关键链路，并处理状态、数据、权限和异常。 价值：把模型能力转化为可交付的软件系统。"},{"id":"retrieval:cap:llmapp:quality-engineering","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"cap:llmapp:quality-engineering","text":"证据与度量驱动的质量工程\n用样本、标签、指标、trace和对照实验评价组件与端到端行为，并把结果连接到发布和改进决策。 表现：能建立可复现评价基线，区分失败层次并用回归证据验证修复。 价值：把主观好坏转成可比较、可追溯的工程决策。"},{"id":"retrieval:cap:llmapp:reliability-security-governance","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"cap:llmapp:reliability-security-governance","text":"生产可靠性、安全与治理\n在数据、工具和服务生命周期中控制权限、安全、可恢复性、性能、成本与合规风险。 表现：能设置最小权限、人工确认、可观测指标、容量边界、回滚和审计记录。 价值：让应用在真实业务约束下可控地运行。"},{"id":"retrieval:cap:llmapp:collaborative-lifecycle-delivery","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"cap:llmapp:collaborative-lifecycle-delivery","text":"协作交付与生命周期改进\n跨业务、产品、数据、算法、后端、运维和评审角色形成可追溯决定、发布物、运行手册与反馈闭环。 表现：能让责任、接口、决定、版本和后续动作对协作方可理解并可执行。 价值：减少知识只存在于个人和交接断裂造成的交付风险。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:model-work-scenario","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:model-work-scenario","text":"建立业务工作场景模型\n以流程图或场景表标出参与者、触发、输入输出、数据、权限、失败代价和当前基线，并由业务方校核。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:define-acceptance-risk","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:define-acceptance-risk","text":"定义验收、约束与失败风险\n把期望行为、不可接受结果、质量阈值、时延成本和人工处置条件写成可执行测试或评审规则。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:compare-solution-paths","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:compare-solution-paths","text":"比较方案并验证关键假设\n在同一需求和样本上比较直接调用、RAG、工作流、Agent或条件性适配，记录收益、代价、风险及不采用理由。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:design-architecture-contracts","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:design-architecture-contracts","text":"设计组件边界、数据流与接口契约\n给出模型、知识、上下文、工具、业务服务和运行环境之间的数据流、状态、接口、错误及责任边界。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:implement-rag-pipeline","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:implement-rag-pipeline","text":"实现可维护的RAG链路\n实现带元数据、权限和版本的摄取、解析、分块、索引、检索、重排及引用链路，并可更新或回退。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:implement-agent-tools","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:implement-agent-tools","text":"实现Agent状态、工作流与工具契约\n实现明确状态、分支、停止条件和工具schema，能演示成功、拒绝、超时、重试及人工介入路径。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:control-context-output","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:control-context-output","text":"控制上下文、输出与模型路由\n版本化管理指令、检索内容、历史、工具描述和token预算，并用schema、校验和模型路由约束目标行为。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:integrate-business-services","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:integrate-business-services","text":"集成业务接口、数据与异步服务\n按照契约接入API、数据库、消息或任务服务，处理认证、超时、错误、幂等和测试环境差异。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:build-evaluation-assets","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:build-evaluation-assets","text":"建设评测数据、标签与量规\n从真实反馈、日志和专家案例构建覆盖典型、边缘及对抗输入的版本化样本，并记录标签规则和分歧处理。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:evaluate-components-e2e","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:evaluate-components-e2e","text":"执行组件与端到端评价\n分别评价检索、生成、工具和端到端任务结果，比较版本并把指标、人工判断与发布门槛关联。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:diagnose-regress","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:diagnose-regress","text":"复现坏例、定位根因并回归\n固定输入与组件版本，重放trace，逐层构造对照，形成根因记录并在原坏例和回归集上验证修复。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:apply-guardrails","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:apply-guardrails","text":"实施数据、权限与工具防护\n依据风险设置数据使用边界、最小权限、输入输出防护、人工确认、拒绝路径与审计信息。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:engineer-observability-recovery","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:engineer-observability-recovery","text":"建立可观测、性能预算与恢复机制\n记录请求、检索、生成、工具和服务指标，验证负载与容量，并演练重试、恢复和回滚。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:coordinate-decisions","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:coordinate-decisions","text":"组织跨角色决定与可追溯文档\n明确业务、数据、算法、开发、运维和评审责任，记录分歧、决定、版本、批准与后续动作。"},{"id":"retrieval:unit:llmapp:manage-release-feedback","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"unit:llmapp:manage-release-feedback","text":"完成发布交接与反馈闭环\n用发布记录、运行手册和知识转移完成交接，把监测、用户反馈和坏例转成有负责人及验收条件的迭代项。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:genai-capabilities-limits","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:genai-capabilities-limits","text":"生成式AI能力边界与失败模式\n理解生成、推理、工具使用的适用条件，以及幻觉、非确定性、分布外输入和能力退化。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:inference-token-context","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:inference-token-context","text":"模型推理、Token与上下文窗口\n理解采样、token预算、上下文窗口、延迟和成本之间的基本关系。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:solution-patterns","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:solution-patterns","text":"直接调用、RAG、工作流、Agent与适配模式\n理解不同解决模式的必要条件、边界、复杂度与组合方式。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:software-data-architecture","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:software-data-architecture","text":"应用架构、数据流与接口契约\n理解组件分层、同步异步交互、状态、数据生命周期、接口和错误契约。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:retrieval-ranking","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:retrieval-ranking","text":"词法、向量、混合检索与重排\n理解BM25、向量相似度、混合召回、过滤、重排及引用的作用位置。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:knowledge-ingestion-governance","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:knowledge-ingestion-governance","text":"知识摄取、分块、元数据、时效与权限\n理解文档解析、分块策略、元数据、去重、版本、更新和访问控制对检索的影响。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:prompt-context-engineering","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:prompt-context-engineering","text":"Prompt与上下文工程\n理解系统指令、示例、外部知识、对话历史、工具结果和上下文压缩的组合原则。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:structured-output-tools","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:structured-output-tools","text":"结构化输出与工具Schema\n理解类型、必填字段、枚举、校验、错误语义和工具描述如何约束模型与系统交互。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:agent-workflow-state","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:agent-workflow-state","text":"Agent循环、工作流状态与记忆\n理解固定工作流与自主Agent的差异，以及状态、规划、记忆、停止条件和人工介入。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:tool-security-idempotency","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:tool-security-idempotency","text":"工具最小权限、人工确认与幂等\n理解工具副作用、授权范围、确认点、重试重执行和幂等键的风险控制。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:evaluation-design","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:evaluation-design","text":"评测目标、真值、量规与抽样\n理解评测目标、数据分布、标签或参考答案、评分量规、抽样偏差和人工校准。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:quality-metrics","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:quality-metrics","text":"检索、生成与任务质量指标\n理解Precision@K、Recall@K、MRR以及生成正确性、相关性、事实性和任务成功指标的适用范围。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:safety-privacy-compliance","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:safety-privacy-compliance","text":"安全、隐私、合规与Prompt注入\n理解数据与个人信息边界、内容风险、Prompt注入、过度代理以及适用监管范围。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:observability-versioning","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:observability-versioning","text":"Trace、日志、指标与版本关联\n理解如何把请求、模型、Prompt、知识、工具、配置和发布版本连接到可查询的运行证据。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:reliability-performance-cost","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:reliability-performance-cost","text":"可靠性、性能、容量与成本\n理解时延、吞吐、并发、队列、缓存、限流、重试、熔断和单位任务成本。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:release-rollback","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:release-rollback","text":"测试、发布、回滚与变更管理\n理解环境、配置、密钥、依赖、迁移、灰度、回滚、运行手册和变更记录。"},{"id":"retrieval:knowledge:llmapp:peft-lora-conditional","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"knowledge:llmapp:peft-lora-conditional","text":"PEFT与LoRA适用条件（条件性）\n理解低秩适配的基本机制、数据要求、训练与推理产物，以及与Prompt/RAG基线比较的必要性。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:interview-map-workflow","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:interview-map-workflow","text":"访谈并绘制工作流程\n围绕具体工作事件追问参与者、输入、动作、判断、异常和交付物，形成可校核流程。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:write-acceptance-failures","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:write-acceptance-failures","text":"编写验收标准与失败模式\n把期望和风险转成给定输入、可观察行为、判定规则和处置动作。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:prototype-compare-models","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:prototype-compare-models","text":"制作原型并比较模型与方案\n固定输入和判定规则，实现最小原型并比较质量、时延、成本、风险和复杂度。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:draw-architecture-contracts","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:draw-architecture-contracts","text":"绘制架构并定义组件契约\n表达组件、数据流、状态、接口、错误和部署边界。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:ingest-chunk-govern","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:ingest-chunk-govern","text":"摄取、分块并治理知识资料\n解析异构资料，设计分块和元数据，保留来源、权限、版本与更新时间。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:configure-retrieval-rerank","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:configure-retrieval-rerank","text":"配置混合检索、重排与引用\n构造查询，配置词法/向量召回、过滤、融合和重排，并将答案连接到来源。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:version-test-context","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:version-test-context","text":"编写、版本化并测试Prompt与上下文\n按职责组织指令、示例、知识、历史和工具信息，记录版本并执行行为测试。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:validate-structured-output","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:validate-structured-output","text":"校验结构化输出与后处理\n定义schema、解析和校验模型输出，处理缺字段、错类型、拒绝和修复。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:implement-state-branches","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:implement-state-branches","text":"实现状态、分支、重试与停止条件\n把工作流程编码为显式状态和路径，处理超时、重试、人工中断、恢复与终止。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:secure-tool-contracts","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:secure-tool-contracts","text":"定义安全工具契约与确认点\n设置工具schema、认证授权、最小权限、确认、幂等键、超时和错误返回。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:integrate-api-data-async","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:integrate-api-data-async","text":"集成API、数据与异步服务\n实现认证、调用、持久化、队列或任务接口，并处理超时、错误和契约测试。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:build-label-eval-set","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:build-label-eval-set","text":"构建并标注评测集\n从日志、反馈和专家案例选样，编写标签和量规，处理分歧并冻结版本。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:run-regression-comparison","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:run-regression-comparison","text":"执行回归、A/B与离线比较\n在固定数据和版本条件下运行组件与端到端评价，比较变化并分析误差。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:instrument-traces-metrics","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:instrument-traces-metrics","text":"埋点Trace、日志、指标与成本\n为请求、检索、生成、工具和服务记录结构化trace、错误、时延、吞吐与成本。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:reproduce-triage-root-cause","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:reproduce-triage-root-cause","text":"复现、分层排障并定位根因\n固定输入与版本，重放链路，对检索、生成、工具、网络和服务逐层构造对照。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:package-deploy-rollback","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:package-deploy-rollback","text":"封装、部署、压测、发布与回滚\n使用容器或目标运行环境封装服务，管理配置密钥，执行集成与负载测试，灰度发布并回滚。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:apply-peft-lora-conditional","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:apply-peft-lora-conditional","text":"实施并比较PEFT/LoRA（条件性）\n准备合格数据，配置适配训练，管理adapter，并与Prompt/RAG/模型基线比较。"},{"id":"retrieval:skill:llmapp:write-runbooks-decisions","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"skill:llmapp:write-runbooks-decisions","text":"编写决策记录、发布说明与运行手册\n用统一结构记录背景、选择、证据、责任、版本、操作步骤、告警和升级路径。"},{"id":"retrieval:scenario:llmapp:deliver-new-application","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"scenario:llmapp:deliver-new-application","text":"从业务需求到大模型应用发布\n业务提出智能化需求后，团队界定场景与验收，选择最小可行方案，完成关键链路、评价与受控发布。"},{"id":"retrieval:scenario:llmapp:update-rag-knowledge","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"scenario:llmapp:update-rag-knowledge","text":"更新知识并守住RAG检索质量\n知识来源发生变化后，按资格、权限和版本摄取，在影子索引上评价检索质量，达标后发布，否则修订或回滚。"},{"id":"retrieval:scenario:llmapp:execute-high-impact-tool","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"scenario:llmapp:execute-high-impact-tool","text":"执行高影响Agent工具调用\nAgent准备执行有副作用的业务动作时，系统校验契约与权限，按风险请求人工确认，用幂等和审计控制调用与恢复。"},{"id":"retrieval:scenario:llmapp:recover-production-badcase","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"scenario:llmapp:recover-production-badcase","text":"诊断线上坏例并恢复生产质量\n线上出现错误答案、错误工具动作或性能退化后，固定版本并重放链路，按检索、生成、工具和服务层分支定位，回归后发布或回滚。"},{"id":"retrieval:actor:deliver:llm-engineer","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"actor:deliver:llm-engineer","text":"大模型应用工程师\n负责方案、关键实现、评价证据和发布闭环。"},{"id":"retrieval:actor:deliver:business-owner","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"actor:deliver:business-owner","text":"业务或产品负责人\n提供流程、目标、约束、样本并确认验收与业务风险。"},{"id":"retrieval:actor:deliver:reviewer-ops","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"actor:deliver:reviewer-ops","text":"评审与运行协作方\n由安全、数据、算法、后端或运维角色按风险参与评审和交接。"},{"id":"retrieval:object:deliver:business-workflow","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"object:deliver:business-workflow","text":"业务流程与基线\n当前参与者、输入输出、质量、时延、成本和失败情况。"},{"id":"retrieval:object:deliver:data-tools","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"object:deliver:data-tools","text":"数据、知识与可用工具\n方案可使用的数据、知识来源、模型、接口及权限。"},{"id":"retrieval:artifact:deliver:scenario-spec","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"artifact:deliver:scenario-spec","text":"场景与验收说明\n记录目标、边界、失败代价、验收案例和责任。"},{"id":"retrieval:artifact:deliver:decision-prototype","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"artifact:deliver:decision-prototype","text":"方案决策与可回放原型\n保留候选路径、取舍、组件边界和关键假设结果。"},{"id":"retrieval:artifact:deliver:evaluation-report","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"artifact:deliver:evaluation-report","text":"版本化评测报告\n连接评测集、指标、坏例和发布门槛。"},{"id":"retrieval:artifact:deliver:release-record","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"artifact:deliver:release-record","text":"发布记录与运行手册\n记录版本、环境、配置、验证、回滚与交接。"},{"id":"retrieval:tool:deliver:model-dev-stack","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"tool:deliver:model-dev-stack","text":"模型与应用开发测试环境\n承载模型调用、知识、工作流、接口、trace和评测。"},{"id":"retrieval:quality:deliver:acceptance-gate","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"quality:deliver:acceptance-gate","text":"业务与技术验收门槛\n覆盖任务结果、质量、安全、时延、成本和可恢复性。"},{"id":"retrieval:risk:deliver:wrong-solution","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"risk:deliver:wrong-solution","text":"场景不适用或方案过度复杂\n模型能力、数据或风险不满足要求，或方案复杂度超过必要水平。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:deliver:01","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:deliver:01","text":"登记需求并收集当前流程证据\n围绕真实工作事件收集用户、输入输出、基线、样本和失败影响。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:deliver:02","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:deliver:02","text":"界定数据、权限、约束与验收\n把目标行为、不可接受结果和评审规则写成可执行说明。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:deliver:03","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:deliver:03","text":"判断大模型方案是否适用\n依据可用数据、风险、失败代价和可验证性决定继续、退回或采用非大模型方案。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:deliver:03R","sn