e:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:rag:02","text":"判断来源是否可用\n检查权威性、独立性、时效、许可、适用范围和权限；不合格来源进入隔离。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:rag:02Q","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:rag:02Q","text":"隔离不合格或边界不明来源\n保留发现线索和拒绝理由，但不进入可发布索引。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:rag:03","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:rag:03","text":"解析、分块并附加元数据与权限\n保留来源定位和版本，处理重复、解析失败、结构差异和访问控制。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:rag:04","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:rag:04","text":"构建影子索引并执行检索\n使用新版本配置构建隔离索引，对受影响和回归查询运行召回、过滤与重排。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:rag:05","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:rag:05","text":"评价召回、排序、引用与权限\n按查询标注计算组件指标，检查坏例、越权、旧知识残留和答案引用。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:rag:06","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:rag:06","text":"判断是否达到检索发布门槛\n比较旧版和新版的组件指标、关键坏例、引用与权限结果。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:rag:07","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:rag:07","text":"发布新知识索引并观察\n切换到新版本，记录时间和范围，监测检索质量、引用与访问异常。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:rag:08","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:rag:08","text":"回滚异常知识或索引版本\n当权限、引用或关键检索质量退化时切回已知良好版本并保留失败证据。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:rag:09","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:rag:09","text":"登记稳定知识版本与待研究坏例\n固定当前有效版本，把未解释查询和新反馈送入后续摄取或诊断。"},{"id":"retrieval:actor:tool:llm-engineer","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"actor:tool:llm-engineer","text":"大模型应用工程师\n定义工作流、工具契约和异常恢复。"},{"id":"retrieval:actor:tool:requester","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"actor:tool:requester","text":"请求者或最终用户\n发起任务并对高影响动作确认或拒绝。"},{"id":"retrieval:actor:tool:security-owner","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","