al:event:tool:02","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:tool:02","text":"校验schema、业务参数与身份\n拒绝缺字段、错类型、越界值、无身份或与上下文不一致的请求。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:tool:03","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:tool:03","text":"判断权限与影响等级\n按身份、数据范围、动作副作用和金额或影响判断拒绝、确认或直接执行。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:tool:03R","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:tool:03R","text":"拒绝越权调用并返回原因\n不调用外部系统，保留最小必要审计并向工作流返回可处理的拒绝结果。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:tool:04","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:tool:04","text":"向用户展示影响并请求确认\n展示将调用的工具、关键参数、影响和取消选项，暂停工作流等待明确选择。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:tool:04R","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:tool:04R","text":"记录用户拒绝并安全终止\n保持业务系统不变，向工作流返回拒绝语义并记录确认版本。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:tool:05","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:tool:05","text":"生成幂等键并执行工具\n将业务操作身份、关键参数和工作流状态绑定后调用外部系统。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:tool:06","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:tool:06","text":"判断调用结果是否明确\n区分成功、业务拒绝、可重试失败和结果未知，未知状态不盲目再次写入。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:tool:06E","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:tool:06E","text":"查询幂等状态或升级人工处理\n对结果未知或不可安全重试的调用查询业务状态、保持暂停或交给授权方处理。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:tool:07","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:tool:07","text":"验证业务结果并更新工作流状态\n核对外部系统实际状态，不仅依赖模型生成的自然语言结论。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:tool:08","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:tool:08","text":"返回可解释结果并封存审计链\n向请求者说明成功、拒绝或待处理状态，保留工具、参数摘要、确认和结果证据。"},{"id":"retrieval:actor:incident:llm-engineer","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"actor:incident:llm-engineer","text":"大模型应用工程师\n复现、分层定位、协调修复与回归。"},{"id":"retrieval:actor:incident:reporter","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"actor:incident:reporter","text":"业务、用户或支持人员\n提供实际问题、期望行为和业务影响。"},{"id":"retrieval:actor:incident:component-owner","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"actor:incident:component-owner","text":"组件负责人或评审者\n对检索、模型、工具或服务分支协作修复并批准发布。"},{"id":"retrieval:object:incident:badcase","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"object:incident:badcase","text":"线上坏例与影响范围\n包含输入、实际输出、期望、时间、用户、业务影响和关联请求。"},{"id":"retrieval:object:incident:version-set","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"object:incident:version-set","text":"模型、Prompt、知识、工具与服务版本集\n复现时必须固定的完整运行基线。"},{"id":"retrieval:artifact:incident:record","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"artifact:incident:record","text":"坏例或事故记录\n记录影响、处置优先级、时间线和负责人。"},{"id":"retrieval:artifact:incident:reproduction","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"artifact:incident:reproduction","text":"最小复现与分层trace\n固定版本后的可回放输入、中间结果和异常。"},{"id":"retrieval:artifact:incident:root-cause","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"artifact:incident:root-cause","text":"根因与修复记录\n列出假设、对照证据、根因、改动和已知限制。"},{"id":"retrieval:artifact:incident:regression-release","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"artifact:incident:regression-release","text":"回归与发布/回滚记录\n连接原坏例、回归集、发布决定和观察结果。"},{"id":"retrieval:tool:incident:trace-eval","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"tool:incident:trace-eval","text":"Trace与回归评测系统\n重放请求、查看中间结果、比较版本并执行回归。"},{"id":"retrieval:tool:incident:deployment","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"tool:incident:deployment","text":"发布、降级与回滚系统\n执行受控修复发布、流量切换和版本恢复。"},{"id":"retrieval:quality:incident:recovery-gate","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"quality:incident:recovery-gate","text":"修复与恢复门槛\n原坏例通过、关键回归不退化、安全和性能可接受且有回滚准备。"},{"id":"retrieval:risk:incident:not-reproducible","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"risk:incident:not-reproducible","text":"版本缺失导致问题不可复现\n未记录模型、Prompt、知识、工具或配置版本，使根因只能推测。"},{"id":"retrieval:risk:incident:fix-regression","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"risk:incident:fix-regression","text":"局部修复造成其他场景退化\n只优化单个坏例而破坏原有质量、安全、时延或成本。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:incident:01","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:incident:01","text":"登记坏例、影响与当前处置\n保存输入、实际与期望结果、业务影响、发生时间并决定告警、降级或回滚优先级。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:incident:02","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:incident:02","text":"固定版本并重放完整链路\n恢复模型、Prompt、知识、工具、配置和输入版本，捕获检索、生成、工具与服务中间结果。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:incident:02E","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:incident:02E","text":"标记不可复现并补采证据\n若版本或trace缺失，明确证据限制，恢复可观测性并从同类输入或新事件继续采样。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:incident:03","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:incident:03","text":"判断主要故障层\n通过中间结果和对照实验区分检索、生成、工具/状态或服务/性能问题。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:incident:04R","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:incident:04R","text":"修复摄取、过滤、召回或重排\n在查询标注上定位缺失、错误排序、过时或越权知识，并修改对应组件。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:incident:04G","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:incident:04G","text":"修复上下文、输出约束或模型路由\n固定检索和工具结果，比较Prompt、上下文、schema或模型版本以验证生成层根因。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:incident:04T","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:incident:04T","text":"修复工具契约、状态或恢复策略\n校正参数、权限、超时、幂等、状态持久化和人工介入，不隐藏工具失败。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:incident:04S","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:incident:04S","text":"修复服务、容量或依赖问题\n用请求、队列、时延、吞吐和错误指标定位资源、网络、依赖或版本回退。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:incident:05","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:incident:05","text":"在原坏例和回归集上复验\n比较修复前后组件与端到端结果，检查质量、安全、时延和成本是否退化。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:incident:06","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:incident:06","text":"判断修复是否可发布\n结合回归、影响、风险批准和回滚准备选择发布、继续修订或保持降级。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:incident:07","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:incident:07","text":"发布修复或回滚并观察同类失败\n记录变更和范围，监测原问题、相邻指标和新坏例，必要时再次降级或回滚。"},{"id":"retrieval:event:incident:08","snapshotId":"snapshot:role:llm-app-engineer@2026-08-24-gold-v1","targetId":"event:incident:08","text":"封存根因并更新基线与运行手册\n把根因、修复、未解决限制和预防动作写入知识与下一轮评价基线。"}]